# Admin Product Metrics Flow

## Purpose

This doc covers the admin-only product metrics dashboard used to inspect portfolio-friendly service outcomes such as activation, generated-result conversion, publish conversion, paid conversion, and retention.
Read this before changing `/admin` metrics, admin product reporting APIs, or the interpretation of these metrics.
The improvement-project and qualitative-metric records the dashboard used to keep were removed on 2026-06-23 (`33b930821`), together with their route and their tables (`product_metric_projects`, `product_qualitative_metrics`, dropped).

